CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792144140
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,APorn showing choking or incest to be
OL,4,Abanned from early November, government
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe new rules follow a review into porn
OL,8,Fregulation in 2025 which found
OL,9,Fdepictions of choking were "rife" on
OL,10,Fpopular porn sites and had helped
OL,11,Fnormalise the act among young people.
OL,13,FConservative peer Baroness Gabby
OL,14,FBertin, who headed the review, said the
OL,15,Fnews came "not a moment too soon".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
