OL,3,ASparks fly at the Celebrity Traitors
OL,4,Around table and a 'terrifying' death
OL,5,Aparade
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,8,Fdetails from the fifth episode of The
OL,9,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,11,FThings are hotting up a bit in the
OL,12,Fcastle, not least for Ross Kemp, who
OL,13,Fdoesn't seem to be enjoying it very
OL,14,Fmuch.
OL,16,F"I'm quite angry," he said, his brow
OL,17,Ffurrowing even more than usual.
OL,19,F"I've suffered at the hands of the
OL,20,Ftraitors and now they've put heat on
OL,21,Fme, so I'm quite angry about that," he
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
