OL,3,ARussell Brand accuser says he turned
OL,4,A'monster-like' before alleged rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FA woman who alleges Russell Brand raped
OL,10,Fher in a hotel room has said he turned
OL,11,Ffrom "camp, friendly and effeminate" to
OL,12,F"monster-like" before the alleged
OL,13,Fassault.
OL,15,FThe 51-year-old actor and comedian
OL,16,Ffaces seven charges - three counts of
OL,17,Frape, three charges of sexual assault
OL,18,Fand one of indecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
